  "paper_diagnosis": "Disseminated cryptococcosis with necrotizing fasciitis in a non-HIV patient",
  "disease_label_per_paper": "Disseminated cryptococcosis with necrotizing fasciitis, meningitis, cryptococcemia, and multiple organ failure in a steroid-exposed non-HIV patient",
